140.43914345353664,35.78151979672604]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"多古町民牛尾体育館","category":"public","address":"多古町牛尾2053-2","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"12347","municipality_pref":"千葉県","municipality_name":"多古町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.4569166138318,35.710725763157875]}}],"display_comment_original":"多古町には、江戸期の多古藩と多古藩陣屋跡に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残る。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、篠本城跡、多古藩陣屋跡、林小原子台遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板、多古村、染井村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。多古藩ゆかりの領主碑や旧領境を示すしるべにも期待できる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["飯篠家直","五十嵐敬止","小川豊明","久松勝慈","渋谷嘉助"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["松崎神社","八坂神社","六所大神","宇賀神社","浄妙寺","東禅寺","日本寺（中村檀林、関東三大檀林）","妙光寺"],"specialties":["多古米（コメ）","多古やまといも（ヤマノイモ）","生産量全国2位、生産額全国1位"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%9A%E5%8F%A4%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q861639","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q73112231","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q46857213","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q10729320","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q131682530","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17217447","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18991721","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6533371","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11482502"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"多古町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109128639","wikidata_qid":"Q1202807","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%9A%E5%8F%A4%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}